\item[* task:] To form an utterance out of a sentence, (and in the
future perhaps to check  polarity).\\
Only finite sentences, or whinterrogative sentences (finite or infinitival)
are accepted as utterance, cf. e.g. {\em wat te doen? }.

\item[\ \ strategy:] (also: deviations from accepted proposals)
